     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"clear:both\">I get a blank geom_tile with my dataset. Is it because of the irregular data or what is the reason? </p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#packages</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#dataset</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>url </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/uc?id=0ByQAkpz-CxFFVFROTVZIUHhpWlE&amp;export=download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/uc?id%3D0ByQAkpz-CxFFVFROTVZIUHhpWlE%26export%3Ddownload&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368797137000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24eNXyWkFasWmOl6Phb-Eo\">https://docs.google.com/uc?id=0ByQAkpz-CxFFVFROTVZIUHhpWlE&amp;export=download</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>download</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">url</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">destfile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.RData&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;wb&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>load</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.RData&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Plot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#geom_tile</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lon</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tamx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">geom_tile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">theme_bw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  coord_equal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lon</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Tamx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">theme_bw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  coord_equal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-vsLiPFPQrQk/VcudBYfs-1I/AAAAAAAAELE/MIAbF4TRVaA/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=